#1100
The Northern Gate~
   You are standing within the great North Gate of Mytherandil.  The
vaulted stone ceiling arches some twenty feet above you, blackened by
the smoke of countless torches, and two massive wooden doors, each a
foot and a half thick and banded with iron, stand wide open against the
walls.  The city seems to have little to fear from the outside, given
the burly guards who are always alert for the dangers that abound in the
Dominion.  Beyond the gate to the north the road leads out into the
wilds, and to the south the clamor of Northgate Square spills in through
the archway.
~
