#1101
Corner of Northgate Road and Western Wall Road~
   You are standing at the northwestern corner of Mytherandil, where the
northern and western walls meet in a squat, round tower.  The northern
wall stands high and proud, casting its long shadow across the cobbles.
Just to the east you can hear a great deal of noise coming from a large
building: the ring of steel on steel and the shouts of men at sword
practice.  To the south, Western Wall Road stretches off toward the West
Gate.
