#1102
Western Northgate Road~
   The twenty-foot wall looms almost directly above you, keeping the
unknown and the dangerous out of the city.  Suddenly you hear a loud
battle cry and a clash of swords, and your hand drops to your weapon by
instinct before you notice the sign above the door to the south: "The
Guild of the Fighter".  The sign also bears the crest of Mytherandil's
famed Warrior Guild, a shield with two clashing swords on its face.
Some of the Dominion's finest swordsmen are members here.  Northgate
Road runs east and west.
