#1115
Reading Room~
   This is a surprisingly quiet room for a warriors' guild.  That is not
to say that it is quiet just outside, but in here you are relatively
safe from the clash of shields and swords and the ferocious battle cries
that assault your ears.  Battered chairs stand about a cold hearth, and
old banners hang from the rafters.  There is a small board on the wall,
its header written in the worst handwriting you have ever laid eyes on:
"The Adventurer's Board".  The training area lies to the east, and the
street to the north.
