#1116
The Warrior's Training Area~
   The Warrior's Training Area is more like a battlefield.  The wounded
are being carried off by medics, and the ground has been churned to mud
by all the walking, bashing, kicking and general wear and tear that come
naturally with a warrior's lifestyle.  Wooden dragons stand about,
almost unrecognizable from the beating they have taken from warriors
honing their axe skills on them.  Several young, almost feral warriors
are trying desperately to hit a small magical ball with their oversized
pikes as it dodges their wild slashes and thrusts.  The reading room
lies back to the west.
