The Black Flint Lantern Shop~
   The putrid smell of sulfur assails your nostrils as you enter the
Black Flint Lantern Shop.  Lanterns and torches of all shapes and sizes
hang from the rafters and crowd the shelves, and kegs of lamp oil are
stacked about the room.  Everything is coated with a thin film of soot,
and the windows are so grimy that the shop is lit only by its own wares.
The door leads south to Darkmin Lane.
