#1133
Mytheran Plaza~
   The famed Plaza of Mytherandil was given to the city by the former
lord of Charing Cross, Darkmane, before that city was taken over by
Spine.  It is the last remaining memory of Charing Cross as it used to
be, and the citizens of Mytherandil value it greatly.  Overhead, a
silver trellis is entwined with vines and hung with potted plants,
filtering the sunlight into green and gold, which makes the plaza the
perfect place for lovers and families to enjoy the day.  Darkmin Lane
runs east and west from the plaza, and Mytheran Road runs north and
south.
