The Burial Chambers~
   The chamber is empty save for a tomb in the center of the room,
carved from white marble and engraved with a set of balanced scales.
Pale yellow candles encircle it, and you can hear chanting coming from
somewhere within the chamber, though in the darkness you cannot see
where the hallowed sounds come from.  It is forbidden to speak here
unless you are murmuring prayers to the great lord.  A small stairway in
one corner of the chamber leads down to the entrance of the tower.
