#1296
Within the Black Monolith~
   You stand inside the monolith, though it is far larger within than
without.  The walls are black glass, and through them you can see
Rithrin Street, dim and silent as if seen through deep water.  In the
center of the chamber stands a great set of bronze scales, perfectly
level, though one pan holds a single white feather and the other a small
stone heart.  Words are carved in the floor around them.  Through the
glass to the east, a shimmering patch shows the way back out to the
street.
~
